    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classanonymous__namespace_02_rewrite_rope_8cpp_03_1_1_rope_piece_b_tree_node" kindref="compound">RopePieceBTreeNode</ref> - Common base class of <ref refid="classanonymous__namespace_02_rewrite_rope_8cpp_03_1_1_rope_piece_b_tree_leaf" kindref="compound">RopePieceBTreeLeaf</ref> and <ref refid="classanonymous__namespace_02_rewrite_rope_8cpp_03_1_1_rope_piece_b_tree_interior" kindref="compound">RopePieceBTreeInterior</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This provides some &apos;virtual&apos; dispatching methods and a flag that determines which subclass the instance is. Also important, this node knows the full extend of the node, including any children that it has. This allows efficient skipping over entire subtrees when looking for an offset in the BTree. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
